      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "The text 'husband' maps to the man in the image",
      "description": "The text 'husband husband you are my husband' explicitly identifies the man in the visual material as the speaker's husband. The repetition of 'husband' in the text creates an analogical mapping where the textual entity 'husband' is projected onto the visual entity 'man'. This mapping is direct and explicit, as the text directly labels the man as 'husband'.",
